Definition kw : ltac2:(zQ "20!hqf!hhr9>1s$1$0") := ltac2:(zQ "60!hhr9!tc!huu0!sa!hqf!mq3\1s$0M0\1s$0$4^1\1a$5\1w$1\1v$3@3$2^3^2^1").
